\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul Pointer}}, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/memory/owned_pointer/OwnedPointer/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul OwnedPointer}} can point to explicitly-destroyed types.\
