\ls36\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Basic file I/O operations in the 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 io
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  module are now implemented natively in Mojo using direct 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 libc
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  system calls (
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 open()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 , 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 close()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 , 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 read()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 , 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 write()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 , 
