\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 os
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  module now exposes a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/os/os/link/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul link()}} function, wrapping the unix 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 link(2)
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  system call.\
\ls36\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 os
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  module now exposes a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/os/os/symlink/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul symlink()}} function, wrapping the unix 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 symlink(2)
