DLHandle
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  is no longer part of the public API. To access a dynamically-linked library from Mojo, use {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/ffi/OwnedDLHandle/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul OwnedDLHandle}} instead. The new type provides RAII-based automatic resource management for dynamically-linked libraries. 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 DLHandle
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  has been renamed to 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 _DLHandle
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and remains available internally for use by the standard library.\
