\ls59\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Mojo now has support for default trait methods, allowing traits to provide reusable behavior without requiring every conforming struct to re-implement it. Default methods are automatically inherited by conforming structs unless explicitly overridden. See {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/manual/traits/#default-method-implementations"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul Default method implementations}} in the Mojo Manual for more information.\
\ls59\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
