\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  environment variable, use 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 mojo build
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  with debug info enabled, e.g. 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 -debug-level=line-tables
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 , and then run the resulting binary.\
