\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul gpu.warp}} modules. Previously, the implementations have been incorrect and would either return wrong results or hang the kernel (due to the deadlock). {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/modular/modular/pull/4508"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul PR 4508}} and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/modular/modular/pull/4553"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul PR 4553}} by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/kirillbobyrev"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul Kirill Bobyrev}} mitigate the found issues and add tests to ensure correctness going forward.\
