\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul Intable}} traits. Instead, it now conforms to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/builtin/int/IntableRaising/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul IntableRaising}}, and users should convert explicitly to built-in types and handle exceptions as needed. In particular, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/python/python_object/PythonObject/#__int__"}}{\fldrslt 
