\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 instance.__init__()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 x.__copyinit__(y)
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  no longer work. Simply replace them with 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 instance = T()
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 x = y
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  respectively.\
