\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 gpu
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  APIs allow you to manually manage interaction between the CPU host and GPU device, manage memory between devices, synchronize threads, and more. Currently the best way to use these APIs is from inside a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/max/develop/custom-ops/"}}{\fldrslt \cf5 \ul MAX custom operation}}.\uc0\u8232 The following code example shows a GPU kernel written in Mojo:\u8232 
