\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The Mojo Language Server and generated documentation now print parametric result types correctly, e.g. showing 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 SIMD[type, simd_width]
