\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Generated API documentation now shows the signatures for structs, and identifies 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 @register_passable
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  and 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 @register_passable("trivial")
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  types.\
\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The VS Code extension now allows cancelling the installation of its private MAX SDK.\
\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The VS Code extension now opens the Run and Debug tab automatically whenever a debug session starts.\
\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 mojo debug --vscode
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  command now support the 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 --init-command
