\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 --stop-on-entry
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  flags. Execute 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 mojo debug --help
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  for more information.\
\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The Mojo LLDB debugger on VS Code now supports inspecting the raw attributes of variables that are handled as synthetic types, e.g. 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 List
