\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 std::vector
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  from C++.\
\ls115\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The VS Code extension now allows selecting a default SDK when multiple are available.\
