\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 mojo test
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  command now accepts a 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 --filter
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  option that will narrow the set of tests collected and executed. The filter string is a POSIX extended regular expression.\
\ls125\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	
\f3 \uc0\u9702 
\f0 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 mojo test
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  command now supports using the same compilation options as 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 mojo build
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 .\
