\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 __TypeOfAllTypes
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1 . This closes a major safety hole in the language. Please use 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 AnyType
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  for generic code going forward.\
