Async and coroutines:\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls134\ilvl1
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	
