The 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 @unroll
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  decorator has been deprecated and removed. The decorator was supposed to guarantee that a decorated loop would be unrolled, or else the compiler would error. In practice, this guarantee was eroded over time, as a compiler-based approach cannot be as robust as the Mojo parameter system. In addition, the 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 @unroll
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  decorator did not make the loop induction variables parameter values, limiting its usefulness. Please see 
\fs28 \cf10 \cb12 @parameter for
\fs32 \cf2 \cb1  for a replacement!\
